import{_ as n,o as i,c as o,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 767 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Cross-IP Benchmark Overview — Cross-IP Comparison of the Transcendence Definition","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 767 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Cross-IP Benchmark Overview — Cross-IP Comparison of the Transcendence Definition","no":767,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Heavens Cross-Reference","Cross-IP Comparison","Overview","Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm"],"related":["01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","701-Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0767_模块4-超脱者与诸天对标-总论.md","filePath":"en/0767_模块4-超脱者与诸天对标-总论.md"}'),a={name:"en/0767_模块4-超脱者与诸天对标-总论.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,d,h){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-767-transcended-ones-and-the-heavens-·-cross-ip-benchmark-overview-—-cross-ip-comparison-of-the-transcendence-definition" tabindex="-1">Entry 767 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Cross-IP Benchmark Overview — Cross-IP Comparison of the Transcendence Definition <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-767-transcended-ones-and-the-heavens-·-cross-ip-benchmark-overview-—-cross-ip-comparison-of-the-transcendence-definition" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 767 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Cross-IP Benchmark Overview — Cross-IP Comparison of the Transcendence Definition&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 01, 04, 701</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-measure-the-cosmos-protagonists-on-the-same-ruler" tabindex="-1">Introduction: measure the cosmos&#39; protagonists on the same ruler <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-measure-the-cosmos-protagonists-on-the-same-ruler" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: measure the cosmos&#39; protagonists on the same ruler&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The first half of Module 4 (701–766) has already built the ruler of &quot;what is true transcendence&quot;: bearing transcendence, civilizational weight, Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, perpetual construction, Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision. From this entry begins a new working segment — inviting those across the cosmos universally recognized &quot;transcended ones&quot; one by one in front of this ruler, measuring whether they truly transcended, to which step, and on which ceiling they are stuck.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here simultaneously act as ruler ticks: the anti-predation axiom measures power&#39;s origin; the republican axiom of Myriad Races measures qualification openness; the collective ascension axiom measures whether the strong one carries Myriad Ranks along; the causal self-discipline axiom measures whether cross-plane operations are reported and controllable; the law-first axiom measures whether the &quot;transcendence&quot; definition itself is self-consistent and will not eat its own book. This entry is the overview of this whole group of benchmark articles; first set up the comparison framework, then entries 768–776 cut case by case.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-cross-ip-comparison-is-needed" tabindex="-1">I. Why Cross-IP Comparison Is Needed <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-cross-ip-comparison-is-needed" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Cross-IP Comparison Is Needed&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cosmos web novels each have their own &quot;transcendence&quot; narrative: Shrouding&#39;s Mortal-World Immortal, Perfect World&#39;s above-Sacrifice-Dao, Douluo&#39;s God Position, Manghuang Ji&#39;s Eternal Peak, Dragon Ball&#39;s Super Saiyan God, Infinite Horror&#39;s Reincarnator Transcendence, Dragon Talisman&#39;s Gu Chensha, Jackie Chan Adventures&#39; talisman ultimate form. Each IP is self-consistent internally, and readers buy it. But once placed side by side, three problems immediately appear:</p><ol><li><strong>Definitions contradict</strong>: work A&#39;s &quot;transcendence&quot; is severing bonds; work B&#39;s &quot;transcendence&quot; is protecting relatives and friends; both cannot be true simultaneously;</li><li><strong>Ceilings differ</strong>: some works&#39; protagonist topping is the endgame; some works&#39; protagonist may continue dimension-uplifting after topping, but the uplift direction is &quot;stronger individual combat power,&quot; not &quot;greater civilizational responsibility&quot;;</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank dimension generally absent</strong>: almost all old IP&#39;s &quot;transcended ones&quot; are humankind-male chosen ones; plant spirits, planet consciousnesses, and cosmos-origin bodies do not even have qualification to compete.</li></ol><p>Cross-IP comparison&#39;s meaning is to spread out these mutually contradictory &quot;transcendence&quot; narratives, using Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s bearing transcendence as the sole judge, finding their shared blind spot — this blind spot is Module 4&#39;s orthodox-definition space to fill.</p><h2 id="ii-comparison-framework-five-dimensions" tabindex="-1">II. Comparison Framework: Five Dimensions <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-comparison-framework-five-dimensions" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Comparison Framework: Five Dimensions&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The cross-IP comparison framework established here is fixed at five dimensions; each later benchmark article scores by these five dimensions:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Core Question</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Full-Marks Standard</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Origin Dimension</td><td>Where does power come from?</td><td>All from the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle, zero predatory residue</td></tr><tr><td>Openness Dimension</td><td>To whom is qualification open?</td><td>99% Myriad-Rank coverage, no race/gender/origin threshold</td></tr><tr><td>Uplift Dimension</td><td>Does the strong one carry Myriad Ranks along?</td><td>The strong one does not ascend alone; civilizational engineering is shared by all</td></tr><tr><td>Causal Dimension</td><td>Are cross-plane operations reported?</td><td>Observe-first-then-limit-interfere; only backflow knowledge, do not disturb causality</td></tr><tr><td>Self-Consistency Dimension</td><td>Is setting stable?</td><td>Law-first axiom; never eat books, never drift with plot</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The five dimensions are not equal-weight. The origin dimension is a one-vote-veto item — as long as power&#39;s origin has predatory residue, no matter how high the other four dimensions, it is only an &quot;advanced predator,&quot; not entering the transcended-one candidate list. This is fully consistent with entry 706&#39;s civilizational-weight formula: origin-legality subitem negative; consensus degree directly negative; effective combat power negative.</p><h2 id="iii-nine-benchmark-samples-positioning-preview" tabindex="-1">III. Nine Benchmark Samples&#39; Positioning Preview <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-nine-benchmark-samples-positioning-preview" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Nine Benchmark Samples&#39; Positioning Preview&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Entries 768–776 will handle the following nine cosmos-recognized &quot;transcended ones&quot; one by one:</p><ul><li><strong>Tang Luo</strong> (Dragon Talisman): gift-system ceiling — the protagonist tops through a higher being&#39;s gift, then locks later-comers in the fierce realm;</li><li><strong>Ye Fan</strong> (Shrouding): oligarchic lone-Dao — one person carrying the whole era; Dao not open, authority not delegated;</li><li><strong>Shi Hao</strong> (Perfect World): single-tree autocracy — above-Sacrifice-Dao one person decides life and death; Myriad Ranks are only protected objects;</li><li><strong>Tang San</strong> (Douluo Continent): predatory closure — the God-Position system is essentially closure after predatory upgrade;</li><li><strong>Goku</strong> (Dragon Ball): aimless combat-power inflation — combat power inflates infinitely but has no civilizational-construction goal;</li><li><strong>Ji Ning</strong> (Manghuang Ji): cultivation-style closure — closed-door retirement after eternal peak (complementary to entry 734&#39;s hang-up critique angle);</li><li><strong>Gu Chensha</strong> (Dragon Talisman): gift-style sin-bearing — bears sin on behalf of all beings but treats them as children;</li><li><strong>Zheng Zha</strong> (Infinite Horror): reincarnation harvest — the reincarnation system itself is a harvesting machine;</li><li><strong>Jackie Chan</strong> (Jackie Chan Adventures): talisman resource waste — civilization-level power used as a toy.</li></ul><p>The nine samples cover nine typical ailments of &quot;gift / oligarch / single-tree / predatory / inflation / closure / sin-bearing / harvest / waste,&quot; exactly corresponding to the old world&#39;s &quot;transcendence&quot; narrative&#39;s nine bankruptcy paths.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-s-methodological-discipline" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison&#39;s Methodological Discipline <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-s-methodological-discipline" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison&#39;s Methodological Discipline&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cross-IP comparison most easily makes two mistakes; this entry first sets rules:</p><ol><li><strong>Do not use Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s moral height to over-criticize old IP</strong>: old IP&#39;s protagonists are already heroes within their planes; this entry criticizes the structural defect of their &quot;transcendence definition,&quot; not denying their personal struggle. Tang Luo, Ye Fan, Shi Hao are all worthy of respect in their own stories, but respect does not equal acknowledging their transcendence definition holds.</li><li><strong>Do not do cheap rehabilitation for old IP</strong>: every benchmark must land on &quot;if this protagonist appeared in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, how should his path be modified&quot; — giving constructive alternative solutions, not only scolding without building. This is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s embodiment in the critique domain: only backflow knowledge, do not disturb old planes&#39; causality.</li></ol><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the nine samples&#39; shared waste is locking overflowing-plane computable power into an individual-narrative endpoint; Heng Yuan Zhou requires this computable power enter perpetual construction</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the origin dimension is one-vote-veto; at least four of the nine samples&#39; power origins carry predatory residue, directly eliminated</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo is the &quot;gift system&quot; extreme among the nine samples; this entry places him first in the benchmark sequence as the old ceiling&#39;s baseline</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the nine samples are all humankind-male chosen ones; the Myriad-Rank dimension is collectively absent; this itself is old IP&#39;s &quot;transcendence&quot; narrative&#39;s greatest structural defect</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the comparison framework itself (the five-dimension scoring table) is open network-wide through the Selfless Dao; any being may use the same ruler to measure any strong one of any IP</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cross-IP comparison is not to step on the cosmos&#39; protagonists, but to raise the threshold of the word &quot;transcendence.&quot; The old world wrote &quot;transcendence&quot; as an individual narrative&#39;s endpoint; Heng Yuan Zhou writes &quot;transcendence&quot; as civilizational engineering&#39;s starting point. Nine benchmark articles use nine mirrors to illuminate what this starting point should look like.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">Entry 01 · Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/701-超脱正统定义总论.html">Entry 701 · Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/706-超脱者的文明权重.html">Entry 706 · Transcended One&#39;s Civilizational Weight</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const g=n(a,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
